## Decision for the desk

The original known-issue page combines distinct problems. This review tracks the shared parser
and the booking-v3 form hint separately. Match duplicates by cause using tenant locale,
channel, and form version. A subject line or intake label cannot establish a common cause.

## Engineering update: 5 October

The [course's engineering update](https://hq.mega.dev/challenges/what-it-shows) records #4471
closed on 2026-10-05, with different outcomes for the two causes:

- Parser: **FIXED** — `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`. The corresponding
  [GitHub issue #1](https://github.com/Kjawo/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1) is closed as completed.
- Hint: **WON'T FIX** — booking-v3 form retired. The corresponding
  [GitHub issue #2](https://github.com/Kjawo/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2) is closed as not planned.

Retiring the form removes the affected path; it does not mean the hint was corrected. These
outcomes come from the engineering update, not an independent test of a deployed application.

